#. module: ai
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai.ai_prompt_summarize_chatter
msgid ""
"Analyze the provided Chatter feed text, stored in the message_ids field\n"
"Strictly ignore all system-generated text (e.g., status changes, file upload "
"notifications, timestamp logs, field updates).\n"
"Focus exclusively on human-written messages to extract the core narrative.\n"
"Produce an executive summary, made of clear bullet points, each of them "
"containing a short sentence\n"
"Keep bullet points punchy and professional. Do not include generic "
"pleasantries (e.g., \"Hello\", \"Thanks\").\n"
"\n"
"Example: \n"
"- John Doe asked if they could have a discount\n"
"- Marc Demo explained that the seasonal discount had expired\n"
"- John answered that in that case, he would have to think about it before "
"signing the deal"
msgstr ""
"Analisis teks feed Chatter yang diberikan, yang disimpan di field "
"message_ids\n"
"Abaikan semua teks yang dihasilkan sistem (misalnya perubahan status, "
"notifikasi unggahan file, log cap waktu, update field).\n"
"Hanya fokus pada pesan yang ditulis oleh manusia untuk mengekstrak narasi "
"inti.\n"
"Buat ringkasan eksekutif berupa poin-poin yang jelas, masing-masing berisi "
"kalimat pendek\n"
"Pastikan poin-poin tetap ringkas dan profesional. Jangan sertakan sapaan "
"umum (misalnya, \"Halo\", \"Terima kasih\").\n"
"\n"
"Contoh: \n"
"- John Doe menanyakan apakah dia bisa mendapatkan diskon\n"
"- Marc Demo menjelaskan bahwa diskon musiman telah berakhir\n"
"- John menjawab bahwa jika demikian, ia harus memikirkannya sebelum "
"menandatangani kesepakatan"

